{
  "id": "REV.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "REV",
  "reference": "Okomaanoka 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nokomaanoka kwa Yeso Kristo oko Nyasae amoete, erinde arokie abasomba baye amang’ana agwenerete gocha gokoreka bwango. Ase ogotoma omomalaika oye akoorokia omosomba oye Yohana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyorenge kirori ase ring’ana ria Nyasae na ase oborori bwa Yeso Kristo, ase ogoteeba amang’ana onsi ayaroche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nare nomogoko ere oyogosoma, na abwo bakoigwa amang’ana obobani obo, na kobwata ayarikireo, ekiagera engaki ng’ang’e ere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amakwania gochia ase chikanisa isano na ibere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korwa ase Yohana gochia ase chikanisa isano na ibere chi’Asia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuya bobe ase more na omorembe bikorwa ase Nyasae ere oyoreo, na oyorengeo, na oyorache kobao, na korwa ase emeika etano na ebere ere bosio bw’ekerogo kiaye ki’obonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na korwa ase Yeso Kristo, oyore kirori omwegenwa, omoiborwa bw’eritang’ani oyobogete korwa ase abakuure, omogambi bw’abarwoti b’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asare ere oyotwanchete na agatobooria korwa ase ebibe biaito namanyinga aye ase ogotokwera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyotokorete koba ab’oborwoti na abakuani ase Nyasae Ise oye asare ere obonene na okobua goika kare na kare. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigereria, ngocha are namare, na kera eriso narimorore, nonya nabwo bamoitete, na abanto b’ebisaku bionsi bi’ense nabeng’ererie ase engencho yaye. Ee, nabo. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche n’Alifa na Omega,” Omonene oteebire, oyoreo, na oyorengeo, na oyorache kobao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborori igoro ya Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Yohana, momura omino, na omobwatani amo nainwe ase emechando, na ase oborwoti, na ase okoremereria amo na Yeso, nigo narenge ase egesinka gekorokwa Patimo, ekiagera nigo narenge koraria ring’ana ria Nyasae na komobera Yeso kirori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ri’Omonene nigo nabogoretigwe n’Omoika, nkaigwa korwa magega aane eriogi rinene, buna eriogi ri’egetureeri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rigoteeba, “Aya orarore oyarike ase egetabu, oyatome ase chikanisa echi isano na ibere echire Efeso, na Sumurina, na Perigamo, na Tiatira, na Saridi, na Filadelfia, na Laodikia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkeonchora ndore eriogi riria rigokwana nainche. Ngachia kweonchora nkarora ebibekerero bie chitaaya bitano na bibere bie chitaabu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gati‐gati y’ebibekerero biria nkarora oyomo onga buna omwana o Mwanyabaanto, obekeire eanga entambe eigete inse ase ebisanyi bi’amagoro, na bweboeretie orokini rw’etaabu gekuba kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etukia yaye nigo yarenge endabu se buna amarionya amarabu, ebirabu se buna amagena embura; na amaiso aye nigo arenge buna ekebemberi ki’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amagoro aye nigo arenge buna etai esenirie koyasibigwe ase eriko ri’omorero, na eriogi riaye buna eriogi ri’amaache amange akoeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase okoboko kwaye gw’okorio nigo abwate ching’enang’eni isano na ibere, na ase omonwa oye okaruao omoyio o birende ore nobwoge chinsemo ibere, na obosio bwaye nigo bware kobara buna erioba rikobara ne’chinguru chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngachia komoorora nkagwa ase amagoro aye, nkaba buna oyokuure. Erio akabeeka okoboko kwaye gw’okorio igoro ase ’nde, aganteebia, Toiroka, inche noyo bw’eritang’ani, na oyo bw’omoerio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na oyore moyo. Inche konya nakuure, na rigereria, nigo inde moyo goika kare na kare, ninde nebigorero bi’amakweri na ebi’aase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono riika amang’ana aya kwarorire, ayareo, na ayarache koba magega y’ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obo nabwo obobisi bwe ching’enang’eni chiria isano na ibere kwarora ase okoboko kwane gw’okorio, na ebibekerero biria bie chitaaya bie chitaabu bitano na bibere: Ching’enang’eni chiria isano na ibere nabamalaika be chikanisa isano na ibere, na ebibekerero biria bitano na bibere nechikanisa isano na ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "REV.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "REV"
  },
